BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 663 Td (3.  Key contractual obligations \(customers, lenders, landlords\) are included.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 646 Td (4.  The list is reviewed when the business, its locations or the law changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 629 Td (5.  Someone is responsible for monitoring regulatory change.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.027 0.212 0.396 rg 56 604 Td (2. ASSIGN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 582 Td (6.  Every obligation has one named owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 565 Td (7.  Owners know they are accountable and what 'compliant' means for each item.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 548 Td (8.  Owners have the authority, time and budget to meet their obligations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 531 Td (9.  Ownership is reassigned promptly when people change roles or leave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 56 514 Td (10. Compliance responsibilities appear in job descriptions or objectives.) Tj ET
